  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "💃 Dance Studio Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for a dance studio, dance school or dance company."
    },
    "intro": "Good dance studio names are cheerful and easy to say, and many borrow a dance term or a bit of theatre: <em>Pointe of View Dance Studio</em>, <em>Stage Left School of Dance</em>, <em>Little Pirouette Dance</em>. The **Dance Studio Name Generator** suggests names for a dance studio, dance school, ballet school or dance company: catchy, cute, funny, classic, modern, Indian classical, your town or your own name.",
    "sections": [
